
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="CERAMIQUE STUDIO - Gốm sứ thủ công mang vẻ đẹp cổ điển hòa quyện cùng phong cách sống hiện đại.">
<title>CERAMIQUE STUDIO | Nghệ thuật gốm sứ</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --navy: #193B46;
  --navy-light: #294E58;
  --beige: #F4EFE5;
  --cream: #FFFCF6;
  --sand: #D9C7AB;
  --brown: #80654D;
  --text: #283A3D;
  --muted: #77766F;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --border: rgba(25, 59, 70, 0.15);
  --shadow: 0 15px 45px rgba(25, 59, 70, 0.09);
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  scroll-padding-top: 90px;
}

body {
  font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}

a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

button, input, select {
  font: inherit;
}

button {
  cursor: pointer;
}

.container {
  width: min(1180px, 90%);
  margin: auto;
}

.eyebrow {
  color: var(--brown);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

h1, h2, h3, .brand-name {
  font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
  font-weight: 500;
}

h2 {
  font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px);
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.section-heading {
  max-width: 600px;
  margin-bottom: 38px;
}

.section-heading p {
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 14px;
  max-width: 540px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 13px 23px;
  border: 1px solid var(--navy);
  background: var(--navy);
  color: white;
  transition: 0.3s ease;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.btn:hover {
  background: var(--navy-light);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.btn-outline {
  color: var(--navy);
  background: transparent;
}

.btn-outline:hover {
  color: white;
}

.topbar {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--beige);
  text-align: center;
  padding: 8px 15px;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  background: rgba(255, 252, 246, 0.96);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.navbar {
  min-height: 78px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 25px;
}

.brand {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  line-height: 1.2;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.brand-name {
  font-size: 24px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  color: var(--navy);
}

.brand-subtitle {
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  color: var(--brown);
  margin-top: 5px;
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 27px;
  list-style: none;
}

.nav-links a {
  font-size: 12px;
  transition: color 0.2s;
}

.nav-links a:hover {
  color: var(--brown);
}

.nav-actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 17px;
}

.icon-btn {
  background: none;
  border: none;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 21px;
  position: relative;
}

.cart-count {
  position: absolute;
  top: -6px;
  right: -9px;
  background: var(--brown);
  color: white;
  border-radius: 50%;
  min-width: 17px;
  height: 17px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-size: 10px;
}

.menu-toggle {
  display: none;
}

.hero {
  background: var(--beige);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hero-grid {
  min-height: 610px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 55px;
  padding-top: 45px;
  padding-bottom: 45px;
}

.hero-content {
  padding: 25px 0;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(42px, 5.3vw, 68px);
  line-height: 1.08;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 20px 0;
}

.hero h1 em {
  color: var(--brown);
  font-weight: 400;
}

.hero-description {
  color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 440px;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.hero-buttons {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
}

.hero-note {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 13px;
  margin-top: 38px;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.hero-note span {
  color: var(--brown);
  font-size: 20px;
}

.hero-visual {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 500px;
}

.hero-image {
  height: 500px;
  border-radius: 180px 180px 4px 4px;
  object-position: center;
}

.hero-caption {
  position: absolute;
  right: -15px;
  bottom: 35px;
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 18px 23px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  max-width: 205px;
}

.hero-caption strong {
  display: block;
  font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.hero-caption span {
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.benefits {
  padding: 27px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.benefit-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.benefit {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  justify-content: center;
}

.benefit-icon {
  font-size: 24px;
  color: var(--brown);
}

.benefit strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.benefit span {
  display: block;
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.section {
  padding: 90px 0;
}

.section-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 35px;
}

.section-top .section-heading {
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.text-link {
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--navy);
  padding-bottom: 5px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.categories {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
}

.category-card {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--beige);
}

.category-card img {
  height: 310px;
  transition: transform 0.6s ease;
}

.category-card:hover img {
  transform: scale(1.05);
}

.category-overlay {
  position: absolute;
  inset: auto 0 0;
  padding: 45px 20px 20px;
  color: white;
  background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(15, 34, 37, 0.82));
}

.category-overlay h3 {
  font-size: 23px;
}

.category-overlay p {
  font-size: 11px;
  opacity: 0.9;
}

.products-section {
  background: var(--beige);
}

.product-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 22px;
}

.product-card {
  min-width: 0;
}

.product-image-wrap {
  position: relative;
  background: #E9E0D2;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.product-image-wrap img {
  height: 285px;
  transition: transform 0.5s ease;
}

.product-card:hover .product-image-wrap img {
  transform: scale(1.04);
}

.product-tag {
  position: absolute;
  left: 12px;
  top: 12px;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--navy);
  padding: 5px 9px;
  font-size: 9px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.add-cart {
  position: absolute;
  right: 12px;
  bottom: 12px;
  width: 39px;
  height: 39px;
  border: none;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 21px;
  transition: 0.25s;
}

.add-cart:hover {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: white;
}

.product-info {
  padding: 15px 2px;
}

.product-category {
  color: var(--brown);
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
}

.product-info h3 {
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 19px;
  margin: 4px 0;
}

.product-info p {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.product-price {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--navy);
}

.story-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 75px;
}

.story-images {
  position: relative;
  padding: 0 40px 40px 0;
}

.story-main-image {
  height: 460px;
}

.story-small-image {
  position: absolute;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 45%;
  height: 220px;
  border: 8px solid var(--cream);
}

.story-content h2 {
  margin: 16px 0 20px;
}

.story-content p {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.story-signature {
  margin-top: 28px;
  padding-top: 22px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 15px;
}

.signature-mark {
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--sand);
  border-radius: 50%;
  font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
  font-size: 21px;
  color: var(--brown);
}

.story-signature strong {
  display: block;
  font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.story-signature span {
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.collection-banner {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--beige);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.banner-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 45px;
}

.banner-content {
  padding: 65px 0;
}

.banner-content .eyebrow {
  color: var(--sand);
}

.banner-content h2 {
  font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
  margin: 16px 0;
}

.banner-content p {
  color: rgba(244, 239, 229, 0.75);
  font-size: 13px;
  max-width: 440px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.banner-content .btn {
  background: var(--beige);
  color: var(--navy);
  border-color: var(--beige);
}

.banner-content .btn:hover {
  background: white;
}

.banner-image {
  height: 390px;
}

.values {
  background: #EEE5D7;
  padding: 65px 0;
}

.values-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 35px;
}

.value-card {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 15px;
}

.value-icon {
  font-size: 29px;
  color: var(--brown);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.value-card h3 {
  font-size: 22px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.value-card p {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 290px;
  margin: auto;
}

.newsletter {
  padding: 75px 0;
  text-align: center;
}

.newsletter h2 {
  margin: 12px 0;
}

.newsletter p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.newsletter-form {
  display: flex;
  max-width: 460px;
  margin: auto;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--navy);
}

.newsletter-form input {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  border: none;
  outline: none;
  background: transparent;
  padding: 13px 5px;
  color: var(--navy);
}

.newsletter-form button {
  border: none;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 0 10px;
}

footer {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--beige);
  padding: 60px 0 20px;
}

.footer-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr;
  gap: 40px;
  padding-bottom: 45px;
}

.footer-brand .brand-name {
  color: var(--beige);
}

.footer-brand .brand-subtitle {
  color: var(--sand);
}

.footer-description {
  color: rgba(244, 239, 229, 0.7);
  font-size: 12px;
  max-width: 260px;
  margin-top: 18px;
}

.footer-column h3 {
  font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.footer-column ul {
  list-style: none;
}

.footer-column li {
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: rgba(244, 239, 229, 0.72);
}

.footer-column a:hover {
  color: white;
}

.footer-bottom {
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(244, 239, 229, 0.2);
  padding-top: 18px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 15px;
  font-size: 10px;
  color: rgba(244, 239, 229, 0.65);
}

.toast {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 25px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, 120px);
  z-index: 300;
  padding: 13px 22px;
  background: var(--navy);
  color: white;
  font-size: 12px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}

.toast.show {
  transform: translate(-50%, 0);
}

@media (max-width: 1000px) {
  .nav-links {
    gap: 15px;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .hero-visual, .hero-image {
    min-height: 430px;
    height: 430px;
  }

  .categories {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }

  .category-card img {
    height: 330px;
  }

  .product-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 28px 18px;
  }

  .product-image-wrap img {
    height: 330px;
  }

  .story-grid {
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .footer-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .container {
    width: 90%;
  }

  .navbar {
    min-height: 68px;
  }

  .brand-name {
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .menu-toggle {
    display: block;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    padding: 22px 5%;
    background: var(--cream);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .nav-links.active {
    display: flex;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
    padding-top: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 45px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 46px;
  }

  .hero-visual, .hero-image {
    min-height: 370px;
    height: 370px;
  }

  .hero-visual {
    margin: 0 8px;
  }

  .hero-caption {
    right: -5px;
    bottom: 20px;
  }

  .benefit-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 24px 12px;
  }

  .benefit {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 65px 0;
  }

  .section-top {
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .categories {
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .category-card img {
    height: 235px;
  }

  .category-overlay {
    padding: 35px 12px 12px;
  }

  .category-overlay h3 {
    font-size: 19px;
  }

  .product-image-wrap img {
    height: 240px;
  }

  .product-info h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .story-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 35px;
  }

  .story-main-image {
    height: 360px;
  }

  .story-small-image {
    height: 170px;
  }

  .banner-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .banner-content {
    padding: 55px 0 30px;
  }

  .banner-image {
    height: 290px;
  }

  .values-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .footer-grid {
    gap: 32px 20px;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    flex-direction: column;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 420px) {
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 39px;
  }

  .hero-buttons .btn {
    padding: 12px 15px;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .categories {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }

  .category-card img {
    height: 195px;
  }

  .product-grid {
    gap: 22px 12px;
  }

  .product-image-wrap img {
    height: 190px;
  }

  .product-info h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .product-info p {
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .footer-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="topbar">
  VẺ ĐẸP CỦA GỐM SỨ — TINH TẾ TRONG TỪNG KHOẢNH KHẮC
</div>

<header>
  <nav class="navbar container">
    <a href="#home" class="brand" aria-label="CERAMIQUE STUDIO trang chủ">
      <span class="brand-name">CERAMIQUE</span>
      <span class="brand-subtitle">STUDIO · EST. 2024</span>
    </a>

    <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <li><a href="#home">Trang chủ</a></li>
      <li><a href="#categories">Danh mục</a></li>
      <li><a href="#products">Sản phẩm</a></li>
      <li><a href="#story">Câu chuyện</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Liên hệ</a></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="nav-actions">
      <button class="icon-btn" id="cartButton" aria-label="Xem giỏ hàng">
        ♧ <span class="cart-count" id="cartCount">0</span>
      </button>
      <button class="icon-btn menu-toggle" id="menuToggle"
        aria-label="Mở menu" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">Nghệ thuật từ đất và lửa</span>
        <h1>Mang vẻ đẹp<br>vượt thời gian<br>vào <em>tổ ấm.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">
          Những món đồ gốm được tạo nên bằng sự tỉ mỉ, kết hợp nét đẹp
          truyền thống với tinh thần sống hiện đại. Đơn giản, gần gũi
          và dành cho mọi thế hệ.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="#products" class="btn">Khám phá bộ sưu tập ↗</a>
          <a href="#story" class="btn btn-outline">Câu chuyện của chúng tôi</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-note">
          <span>✳</span>
          <p>Chất liệu tự nhiên · Thiết kế tinh tế · Giá trị bền lâu</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <img class="hero-image"
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578749556568-bc2c40e68b61?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85"
          alt="Bộ gốm sứ thủ công với tông màu đất ấm áp">
        <div class="hero-caption">
          <strong>Made with care.</strong>
          <span>Mỗi món gốm, một câu chuyện riêng.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="benefits">
    <div class="container benefit-grid">
      <div class="benefit">
        <div class="benefit-icon">✳</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Thiết kế tinh giản</strong>
          <span>Đẹp trong mọi không gian</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit">
        <div class="benefit-icon">♧</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Cảm hứng tự nhiên</strong>
          <span>Màu sắc nhẹ nhàng, hài hòa</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit">
        <div class="benefit-icon">◇</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Phù hợp nhiều thế hệ</strong>
          <span>Gần gũi và dễ sử dụng</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit">
        <div class="benefit-icon">♡</div>
        <div>
